# --- COPY THIS FILE TO `android/keystore.properties` AND EDIT THE VALUES ---
# Do NOT commit android/keystore.properties — it contains real passwords.
#
# 1. From inside the android/ folder, generate the keystore ONCE:
#    keytool -genkeypair -v ^
#      -keystore doorsign-release.keystore ^
#      -alias doorsign ^
#      -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 36500
#
#    It will ask for two passwords (store + key) and your name/org.
#    Keep the resulting `doorsign-release.keystore` file safe — losing it
#    means you can never publish an update to the same installed app again.
#
# 2. Copy this file to `android/keystore.properties` and fill in the values:
storeFile=doorsign-release.keystore
storePassword=CHANGE_ME
keyAlias=doorsign
keyPassword=CHANGE_ME
